      <activity id="29bb3019-ecfa-5162-874a-e846bc2b7b4d" activityNameId="8da2b34e-8769-5284-b02d-5444bd2a7fdb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyvinylchloride, suspension polymerised, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyvinylchloride, suspension polymerised, at plant
A methane emissions update has been incorporated into the LCI of datasets downloaded from the PlasticsEurope website. UUID=48985f3e-97b4-3128-a1a8-a5ba91a1cb88
The polymerisation  process, upstream processes like ethylene, chlorine, and VCM production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.
Location: EU27 including Norway and Switzerland
Technology: The polymerisation process, upstream processes like ethylene, chlorine, and VCM production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.

Time period: time to which data mainly refer: 2014 with the methane emission updates in 2023
Production volume: referring to covered E-PVC nameplate capacity (60 % of 3,403 kt in 2013)
Sampling: Questionnaires sent out to all production units in Europe operated by ECVM member companies.
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_48985f3e-97b4-3128-a1a8-a5ba91a1cb88.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
